fixture zone1_12_no_kindle_door_holds
doc Control for zone 1 room 12 (tech 12): the jump, the air dash and the air jump over the chasm without the Kindle Votive; the wax door is a wall, nothing crosses it, the spikes take the fall
room zone1/12_kindle_dash
spawn 1000 544
frames 140
input
  0..9 R
  10 R jump
  11..16 R
  17 R dash
  18..40 R
  41 R jump        # the air jump, against the wax
  42..59 R
end
expect
  never 0..139 event.ignite=1
  never 0..139 x>1270u
  never 0..139 room=zone1_01_dash_slash
  mark hurt 60..139 event.hazard=1
end
